dashboard-mask-top.png and dashboard-mask-bottom.png: the scroll fades over a phone's open
notification area (LunaSysMgr's DashboardWindowContainer, the phone path), copied on
2026-10-16 from /usr/palm/sysmgr/images/1.5/ on the reference Pre3 (AT&T, HP webOS 2.2.4,
stock files). They are drawn for the Pre3's ScaleFactor of 1.5, and Lunacy decodes them at
that density (Luna.pre3Image). HP webOS system images, not in LunaCE's repository; shipped
as abandonware, like the Prelude fonts and the TouchPad wallpapers.

mojo/dashboard-container.png, dashboard-container-active.png and dashboard-container-sprite.png:
Mojo's dashboard boxes as the Pre3 drew them, copied on 2026-10-16 from
/usr/palm/frameworks/mojo/submissions/383/images/ on the same Pre3. The TouchPad's Mojo ships
these three transparent (its dashboards sit in the drop-down with no box); every other
notification image is byte-identical between the two. In phone mode the app server serves
these in place of mojocommon's (AppServer.asset). HP webOS framework images, abandonware.
